    "detailed_description": "Ignite your rocketship engines and zoom your way through the caves of tiltfire.<br>Fly around tight corners and blast AI drones in this fast paced top-down shooter.<br><br>In tiltfire you control a rocketship through linear 2D caves,<br>which are riddled with obstacles and hostile AI controlled drones.<br>In every cave your goal is to reach the teleporter, which teleports you to the next cave.<br>The game keeps track of your record time per stage.<br><br>Simple, yet convincing physics makes flying in tiltfire a joyride.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Dead simple, buttery smooth controls.<br></li><li>Over 60 meticulously designed levels spanning across 12 stages. <br></li><li>High explosive missiles, homing missiles, laser guns, fast firing machine guns.<br></li><li>Dodge spinning saw blades and laser traps.<br></li><li>You get to choose from 3 different guns which vary in style.<br></li><li>Different types of drones which use different guns.<br></li><li>An electronic soundtrack, which suits the look and feel of the game.</li></ul><br>Created by a solo developer.<br><br>Tiltfire Original Soundtrack by Dry Valley and \\aleph_{0}.",
